    --- message[2] role='employee' ---
The park-and-ride is four miles from my house. No sidewalk on that road. I'd have to walk in the dark at 4:45 AM with my kid to drop her at the 24-hour daycare by 5:15, then walk back, then catch the van. In February.
    --- message[3] role='hr_rep' ---
