    --- message[7] role='hr_rep' ---
Let me talk to the supervisor about the shift change policy. That circular logic — penalized for transit, then barred from the fix because of the penalty — shouldn't stand. In the meantime, document every late bus with time-stamped photos. It won't stop the write-up but it builds a record if it escalates.

